      "writtenOn": "2021-12-14T23:46:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Most of these cases are defined somewhere in the wpa_supplicant source code. I added a comment to the top of this file, and all the similar files, to point to the file with the main definition.\n\nFor example, with this type, the reference definition would be here: cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/wpa_supplicant_8/src/common/defs.h;l\u003d177",
      "parentUuid": "0fa64001_75e8448a",
